{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33902","headline":"谏议以罢郡将归以六韵赐示因伫詶献 · 皮日休","name":"谏议以罢郡将归以六韵赐示因伫詶献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲下持衡诏，先容解印归。\n露浓春後泽，霜薄霁来威。\n旧化堪治疾，余恩可疗饥。\n隔花攀去櫂，穿柳挽行衣。\n佐理能无取，酬知力甚微。\n空将千感泪，异日拜黄扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}